Package: veritas-agent
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Veritas <support@veritas.app>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-requests, python3-yaml, systemd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/shreyaaassss/Veritas
Description: Veritas DPDPA Agent — telemetry forwarder
 Lightweight log and event forwarder for the Veritas DPDPA Compliance Platform.
 Reads from log files and Docker containers, forwards events to the Veritas
 server for PII detection and compliance analysis.
 .
 Install this on every server you want to monitor. The Veritas server
 (veritas package) must be installed and licensed separately.
